    "analysis": "A demo project showing how to run Claude Code or Codex inside AgentFS, a fully-virtualized filesystem, orchestrated by LlamaIndex Workflows. All file operations are routed through a custom filesystem MCP server backed by a LibSQL database, with non-text files (PDF/DOCX/PPTX/XLSX) parsed via LlamaCloud/LlamaParse into markdown for the agent to read. It targets developers exploring agent sandboxing patterns, human-in-the-loop workflows, and virtualized file access for coding agents, built in TypeScript with vitest tests.",
